---
title: "createFixedPriceSale (LegionFixedPriceSaleFactory)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_owner: onlyOwner
    q_check_owner --> q_revert: msg.sender != owner
    q_revert --> [*]: revert Unauthorized()
    q_check_owner --> q_clone: msg.sender == owner
    q_clone --> q_emit: saleInstance = LibClone.clone(fixedPriceSaleTemplate)
    q_emit --> q_init: emit NewFixedPriceSaleCreated(saleInstance)
    q_init --> [*]: saleInstance.initialize(saleInitParams, fixedPriceSaleInitParams)

    note right of q_clone
        INV-001: EIP-1167 minimal proxy clone pattern
        INV-002: clone is a new contract with its own storage
        INV-003: initialize called immediately after cloning (single tx)
        INV-004: only factory owner (Legion) can create new sales
    end note
